#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:583
msgid "Connection security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:586
msgid ""
"This setting controls the type of security Mattermost uses to connect to "
"the AD/LDAP server, with these options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:589
msgid ""
"**None**: **(Default for self-hosted deployments)** No encryption. With "
"this option, it is **highly recommended** that the connection be secured "
"outside of Mattermost, such as by a stunnel proxy. ``config.json`` "
"option: ``\"\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:593
msgid ""
"**TLS**: **(Default for Cloud deployments)** Encrypts communication with "
"TLS. ``config.json`` option: ``\"TLS\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:595
msgid ""
"**STARTTLS**: Attempts to upgrade an existing insecure connection to a "
"secure connection with TLS. ``config.json`` option: ``\"STARTTLS\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:587
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``ConnectionSecurity`` > "
"``\"\"``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:588
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_CONNECTIONSECURITY``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:609
msgid "Skip certificate verification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:612
msgid ""
"**true**: Disables the certificate verification step for TLS and STARTTLS"
" connections. Use this option for testing. **Do not use** this option "
"when TLS is required in production."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:613
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Enables certification verification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:613
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > "
"``SkipCertificateVerification`` > ``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:614
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_SKIPCERTIFICATEVERIFICATION``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:625
msgid "Private key"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:628
msgid ""
"Use this setting to upload the private key file from your LDAP "
"authentication provider, if TLS client certificates are the primary "
"authentication mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:629
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PrivateKeyFile``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:630
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PRIVATEKEYFILE``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:641
msgid "Public certificate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:644
msgid ""
"Use this setting to upload the public TLS certificate from your LDAP "
"authentication provider, if TLS client certificates are the primary "
"authentication mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:645
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``PublicCertificateFile``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:646
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_PUBLICCERTIFICATEFILE``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:662
msgid ""
"You can unlock the account in System Console on the users page. Setting "
"this value lower than your LDAP maximum login attempts ensures that the "
"users won't be locked out of your LDAP server because of failed login "
"attempts in Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:661
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``MaximumLoginAttempts`` > "
"``10``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:662
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_MAXIMUMLOGINATTEMPTS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:670
msgid ""
"Adjust this value to align with your organization’s authentication "
"policies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:671
msgid ""
"If a user's account is locked, you can unlock it manually by going to "
"**System console > User Management > Users**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:675
msgid "User filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:677
msgid ""
"Define how Mattermost identifies and filters users and groups from your "
"AD/LDAP directory. Use the **Test Filters** button in this section to "
"verify your filters work correctly before proceeding to other "
"configuration steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:687
msgid "Base DN"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:690
msgid ""
"This is the **Base Distinguished Name** of the location in the AD/LDAP "
"tree where Mattermost will start searching for users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:691
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``BaseDN``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:692
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_BASEDN``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:703
msgid "User filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:706
msgid ""
"This setting accepts a `general syntax "
"<https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-"
"syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP filter that is applied when searching for user "
"objects. Only the users selected by the query can access Mattermost. For "
"example, to filter out disabled users, the filter is: "
"``(&(objectCategory=Person)(!(UserAccountControl:1.2.840.113556.1.4.803:=2)))``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:708
msgid ""
"To filter by group membership, determine the ``distinguishedName`` of the"
" group, then use group membership general syntax to format the filter. "
"For example, if the security group ``distinguishedName`` is "
"``CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com``, then the filter is: "
"``(memberOf=CN=group1,OU=groups,DC=example,DC=com)``. The user must "
"explicitly belong to this group for the filter to apply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:707
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``UserFilter``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:708
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_USERFILTER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:714
msgid ""
"This filter uses the permissions of the **Bind Username** account to "
"execute the search. This account should be specific to Mattermost and "
"have read-only access to the portion of the AD/LDAP tree specified in the"
" **Base DN** field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:724
msgid "Group filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:730
msgid ""
"This setting accepts a `general syntax "
"<https://www.ldapexplorer.com/en/manual/109010000-ldap-filter-"
"syntax.htm>`__ AD/LDAP filter that is applied when searching for group "
"objects. Only the groups selected by the query can access Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid ""
"String input. Default is "
"``(|(objectClass=group)(objectClass=groupOfNames)(objectClass=groupOfUniqueNames))``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:731
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GroupFilter``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:732
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GROUPFILTER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:736
msgid ""
"This filter is only used when AD/LDAP Group Sync is enabled. See "
":doc:`AD/LDAP Group Sync </administration-guide/onboard/ad-ldap-groups-"
"synchronization>` for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:748
msgid "Enable admin filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:751
msgid ""
"**true**: Enables the **Admin Filter** setting that designates system "
"admins using an AD/LDAP filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:752
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Disables the **Admin Filter** setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:752
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``EnableAdminFilter`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:753
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ENABLEADMINFILTER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:757
msgid ""
"If this setting is ``false``, no additional users are designated as "
"system admins by the filter. Users that were previously designated as "
"system admins retain this role unless the filter is changed or removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:767
msgid "Admin filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:770
msgid ""
"This setting accepts an AD/LDAP filter that designates the selected users"
" as system admins. Users are promoted to this role on their next sign-in "
"or on the next scheduled AD/LDAP sync."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid ""
"If the Admin Filter is removed, users who are currently logged in retain "
"their Admin role until their next sign-in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:771
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``AdminFilter``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:772
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_ADMINFILTER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:785
msgid "Guest filter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:788
msgid ""
"This setting accepts an AD/LDAP filter to apply when searching for "
"external users with Guest Access to Mattermost. Only users selected by "
"the query can access Mattermost as Guests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:790
msgid ""
"See :doc:`Guest Accounts </administration-guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` "
"for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:789
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``LdapSettings`` > ``GuestFilter``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:790
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_LDAPSETTINGS_GUESTFILTER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:796
msgid "Account synchronization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings.rst:801
msgid ""
"Map AD/LDAP user attributes to Mattermost user profile fields. Use the "
"**Test Attributes** button in this section to verify correct attribute "
